WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.816
A series is an ongoing run of episodes, like member calls or live events.

2
00:00:06.816 --> 00:00:09.930
Go to Library, then Series, and open the series.

3
00:00:14.531 --> 00:00:21.021
Series settings controls what each episode is called, and whether members see the newest or the oldest episode first.

4
00:00:22.611 --> 00:00:25.647
New episodes start from the Series episodes box.

5
00:00:25.647 --> 00:00:30.012
The add link opens a new episode that already belongs to this series.

6
00:00:31.609 --> 00:00:37.070
Give the episode a title, then paste its video link into the Media box, just like a course lesson.

7
00:00:44.219 --> 00:00:49.075
Placement shows the series it belongs to. You don't set access on each episode.

8
00:00:49.075 --> 00:00:50.734
Episodes follow the series.

9
00:00:52.299 --> 00:00:56.309
Publish, and the episode is listed on the series, ready to flow to the app.
